  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria-Iraq 2022-2025. Baytna</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to strengthen the capacity of civil society to act as a force for democratic change, inclusive peace and stability, and to promote respect for human rights and civil liberties using different tools and approaches including advocacy, lobbying and policy making. To that end, Baytna will particularly focus on developing its Knowledge function and its Advocacy work.</narrative>
  </description>
